'''High Lord Babel''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] event. He was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]]. [[True Form]] added [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] increases health, gains [[Colossus Slayer]], immunity to [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback]] and [[Immune to Toxic|toxic attacks]].

