==Trivia==
*High Lord Babel was the first unit to have the [[Insanely Tough]] ability.
*High Lord Babel, [[Relentless Gladios (Uber Rare Cat)|Relentless Gladios]] and [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea Serpent Daliasan]] are the only [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Dragon Emperors]] to have a prefix in Normal Form.
*High Lord Babel has the highest health of all [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]].
*High Lord Babel is the second-most expensive cat unit in the entire game, only beaten by the [[:Category:Killer Cats|Killer Cats]], who are tied with 7,500¢.
*High Lord Babel and his design as a whole are a reference to the Tower of Babel in Genesis.
*Babel the Darkflame bears some resemblances to the [https://preview.redd.it/22an5zs3iv461.png?width=448&format=png&auto=webp&s=b92b2e57533f5b64635cdc84c17dd95b64fbd8a9 dark dragon] between [[wikia:yugioh:Zorc Necrophades|Zorc Necrophades]]' legs in ''[[wikipedia:Yu-Gi-Oh!|Yu-Gi-Oh!]]'', with the biggest similarity being the neck.
*Despite his name, Babel the Darkflame ironically doesn't have fire anywhere in his design or attack animation.
*High Lord Babel is the first Legend Rare Unit to have a [[True Form]].

